  "description": "BLACK FRIDAY DEAL\nSave $300\nHBBC Men's Electric Cruiser: Classic Beach Cruiser Style, Electric PowerClassic Huntington Beach cruiser comfort meets a high-torque electric system designed for smooth street, boardwalk, and everyday coastal riding. Designed in Huntington Beach, the Men's Electric Cruiser is remarkably light at 55 lb for an eBike with up to 85 Nm of torque.The E-Cruiser advantage\n\nNatural torque-sensing assist: The advanced 6-pin torque sensor measures how hard you press the pedals for smooth, natural response.\n\nHidden electric power: A Bafang 750W rear-hub motor delivers up to 85 Nm of torque for strong starts and confident hill climbing.\n\nBalanced 48V electronics: The 48V/13Ah battery uses premium LG 5.0 21700 cells and is UL 2849-certified. It works with a 22A controller and oversized 30A BMS for stable power delivery and thoughtful thermal management.\n\nClean cruiser styling: The electric system is integrated into the bike without a bulky external controller box.\n\nPremium road package: Tektro hydraulic disc brakes, heavy-duty 12G spokes, integrated smart lighting, and an active brake-responsive tail light.\n\n*Range varies by rider weight, terrain, speed, temperature, tire pressure, and assist level. Throttle-only range is measured in Eco Mode at 20 mph.Electric Cruiser FAQHow does the torque sensor work?The 6-pin torque sensor measures your pedal pressure and helps the motor respond to your effort.How much power and torque does the motor have?The E-Cruiser uses a Bafang 750W rear-hub motor with up to 85 Nm of torque.What battery and electronics does it use?It uses a 48V/13Ah, UL 2849-certified battery system with premium LG 5.0 21700 cells, a 22A controller, and a 30A BMS.How far can I ride on one charge?Range is up to 50 miles with pedal assist or approximately 28–35 miles with throttle-only riding. Real-world range depends on how and where you ride.What brakes, spokes, and lights are included?Tektro hydraulic disc brakes, heavy-duty 12G spokes, integrated smart lighting, and an active brake-responsive tail light are included.",
